###
@Token = paste-the-token-here

### Public catalog (RF09)
GET {{Gateway}}/api/products?onlyInStock=true

### Alert thresholds (RF04)
GET {{Gateway}}/api/sensor-thresholds
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Your notifications
GET {{Gateway}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
